WEBVTT

01:28.360 --> 01:35.690
Our Secret
EP18

01:35.690 --> 01:37.520
President, is Xing Lufei here?

01:37.610 --> 01:38.800
The costume sector has been urging us.

01:39.120 --> 01:40.010
Wait a second.

01:40.930 --> 01:41.970
I'll give her a call.

01:42.330 --> 01:43.010
Okay.

01:43.800 --> 01:45.890
What's the rush? Here I am.

01:46.330 --> 01:47.370
It's great to have you, Xing.

01:47.930 --> 01:49.250
How's the costume going?

01:49.760 --> 01:51.760
Almost done. There are still two sets to go.

01:52.840 --> 01:54.520
Have a look at this form, please.

01:56.569 --> 01:58.720
Is there any part to be finished?

02:03.840 --> 02:07.370
Xing, where did you get these chocolates?

02:07.610 --> 02:08.920
They are from Zhou Siyue.

02:20.280 --> 02:21.160
Song Ziqi

02:22.130 --> 02:22.690
I thought you said you'd

02:22.850 --> 02:24.770
rather be dead than eat my food.

02:26.520 --> 02:27.520
Zhou Siyue

02:30.440 --> 02:32.410
Why did you give the chocolates to her?

02:36.440 --> 02:38.250
Xing Lufei took them herself.

02:38.250 --> 02:39.250
No more excuses.

02:40.889 --> 02:43.280
Just tell me if you are not that into me.

02:44.360 --> 02:45.889
Why did you do this to me?

02:47.560 --> 02:48.560
Honestly,

02:49.560 --> 02:50.280
you also don't support me to get in

02:50.490 --> 02:52.130
the scientific research group, right?

02:55.250 --> 02:56.160
Right.

03:00.890 --> 03:02.490
You don't care about it at all.

03:02.920 --> 03:04.890
You know clearly the only reason I choose

03:05.080 --> 03:06.080
computer department and get in the group

03:06.250 --> 03:07.250
is for you.

03:08.360 --> 03:10.970
I do all these to make us a better future.

03:12.050 --> 03:13.050
I try to get close to you.

03:13.210 --> 03:14.560
I don't care whether it fits me or not.

03:14.560 --> 03:15.440
Or whether I'm good at it or not.

03:20.130 --> 03:22.080
But I realized that

03:22.770 --> 03:25.210
you haven't even taken any actions to be with me.

03:26.889 --> 03:29.210
Because it matters to me whether it fits you or not

03:29.210 --> 03:30.440
and whether you're good at it nor not.

03:31.920 --> 03:32.850
Ding Xian

03:33.000 --> 03:34.330
I told you already

03:34.490 --> 03:35.610
the day you had the interview for the research group.

03:36.800 --> 03:38.770
I hope you could think about yourself clearly

03:38.970 --> 03:40.410
before you make every decision,

03:40.720 --> 03:42.360
But not thinking about me all the time.

03:42.360 --> 03:43.520
Think clearly about what?

03:45.800 --> 03:48.160
I don't understand. I really don't.

03:48.889 --> 03:51.130
You keep saying they are all my decisions.

03:51.130 --> 03:52.130
What about you?

03:53.970 --> 03:56.889
Don't you have a crush on me at all?

03:58.410 --> 03:59.920
Does the three years' memory

03:59.920 --> 04:02.000
mean nothing to you?

04:15.520 --> 04:16.520
I see.

04:19.050 --> 04:21.240
I'll never come to you again.

04:21.680 --> 04:22.649
Ding Xian

04:37.650 --> 04:38.960
Aren't you going to explain it to her?

04:47.930 --> 04:48.930
Maybe leaving me is the only way for her

04:50.810 --> 04:53.560
to think about herself more.

04:55.120 --> 04:56.650
You are causing troubles for yourself.

05:11.400 --> 05:13.560
Cancel the meeting with the client at 8 p.m. tonight for me.

05:13.770 --> 05:15.650
I've got an emergency.

05:35.050 --> 05:35.890
Xianxian

05:36.120 --> 05:37.000
What a coincidence.

05:37.560 --> 05:38.560
Su

05:39.530 --> 05:40.810
What are you doing here?

05:41.160 --> 05:42.610
I have a meeting with a client nearby.

05:42.890 --> 05:44.280
Let me give you a ride.

05:48.210 --> 05:50.090
Why are you still outside at this hour of night?

05:52.000 --> 05:53.330
I feel bored.

05:53.810 --> 05:55.210
I wanna take a bus,

05:55.530 --> 05:57.240
but I have nowhere to go.

06:01.930 --> 06:02.890
Su

06:02.890 --> 06:04.560
Why are you in a business suit?

06:06.090 --> 06:07.960
I could hardly recognize you.

06:08.560 --> 06:10.210
I'm in a start-up now.

06:10.770 --> 06:12.000
It's inevitable to meet

06:12.210 --> 06:13.370
clients anytime.

06:13.610 --> 06:15.960
So to dress formally is required.

06:16.960 --> 06:18.440
You have no time for dating, I suppose,

06:19.440 --> 06:22.840
since you are so busy.

06:25.210 --> 06:26.120
What's wrong?

06:27.770 --> 06:29.770
Nothing, the red light.

06:34.650 --> 06:35.890
I don't have a girlfriend.

06:40.050 --> 06:41.330
So there's no need to worry about

06:42.490 --> 06:43.770
how to balance work and life.

06:48.370 --> 06:49.240
Xianxian

06:49.960 --> 06:52.440
Would you like to watch the art exhibition

06:52.440 --> 06:53.490
you liked before?

06:54.770 --> 06:56.050
Right now?

07:33.770 --> 07:35.050
You are much fascinated.

07:37.400 --> 07:38.530
Seemingly,

07:39.440 --> 07:41.400
I feel much relaxed only

07:42.530 --> 07:44.840
in the art exhibition.

07:46.050 --> 07:48.240
I remember you were quite good at drawing.

07:48.440 --> 07:49.770
Are you still drawing?

07:51.930 --> 07:54.210
I joined the Comics Club in school.

07:55.240 --> 07:57.330
I draw when the club holds the activity.

07:59.330 --> 08:00.960
I think you can keep it up.

08:01.210 --> 08:02.680
Don't waste your talent.

08:05.000 --> 08:06.120
But

08:08.240 --> 08:10.930
I seem to barely recognize myself.

08:13.930 --> 08:14.840
Did something happen

08:15.530 --> 08:17.240
to you today?

08:17.960 --> 08:19.000
You seem quite upset.

08:24.400 --> 08:25.440
Never mind.

08:25.720 --> 08:27.120
It's okay if you don't want to talk about it.

08:28.330 --> 08:30.330
People always get confused.

08:31.720 --> 08:32.920
It's okay to be not like yourself

08:33.530 --> 08:35.530
or to make comprises for life.

08:35.969 --> 08:38.560
You'll finally find your own way.

08:39.729 --> 08:40.800
What important is that

08:42.119 --> 08:43.920
never forget why you started.

08:46.170 --> 08:47.000
Besides,

08:48.730 --> 08:51.240
you don't need to follow anyone.

09:06.970 --> 09:07.920
Where's Ding Xian?

09:10.650 --> 09:12.170
She asked for a sick leave.

09:12.170 --> 09:13.360
She doesn't feel well.

09:25.000 --> 09:26.650
Why does she ask for a leave frequently?

09:26.970 --> 09:28.970
She may get fired by Professor Ye if she keeps doing like that.

09:30.000 --> 09:31.680
You are talking too much.

10:02.410 --> 10:03.410
Hello, dad.

10:03.650 --> 10:05.170
Hey, Xianxian.

10:05.440 --> 10:06.480
What have you been doing lately?

10:06.800 --> 10:08.770
You haven't called us for a long time.

10:11.650 --> 10:13.210
I got too busy lately for the school stuff.

10:14.330 --> 10:16.680
Have you got a cold? Your voice sounds strange.

10:16.920 --> 10:18.360
Got a cold?

10:19.730 --> 10:21.360
Tell her to drink some water.

10:21.600 --> 10:23.290
Did she wear too few clothes?

10:24.410 --> 10:26.480
Go to the hospital if she doesn't feel well.

10:26.920 --> 10:28.600
Do you hear your mom?

10:31.090 --> 10:32.090
Nuh...

10:32.290 --> 10:34.210
I didn't catch a cold. Don't worry.

10:34.970 --> 10:36.890
Is there anything wrong?

10:36.890 --> 10:38.170
Tell daddy what happened.

10:39.770 --> 10:41.040
You can't understand at all.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.170
Xianxian

10:42.600 --> 10:43.440
Listen to me.

10:43.890 --> 10:46.240
Now it's the beginning of a new season.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.440
You gotta wear more clothes to keep warm.

10:47.890 --> 10:49.000
When you come back,

10:49.210 --> 10:50.920
mommy will cook you some good meals.

10:52.410 --> 10:55.120
Mom, I feel quite good.

10:55.560 --> 10:56.970
Just don't worry.

10:58.170 --> 10:59.600
I'm tied up.

10:59.890 --> 11:01.210
I'll hang up.

11:10.170 --> 11:12.290
No matter you choose the liberal arts or science subjects,

11:12.920 --> 11:14.530
never mind others' opinions.

11:14.800 --> 11:16.410
Just choose what you like

11:16.600 --> 11:17.600
and what you're good at.

11:17.970 --> 11:19.770
I'll be there to support you anyway.

11:20.090 --> 11:21.330
What if I tell you

11:21.650 --> 11:23.120
it was him who told Professor Ye

11:23.440 --> 11:24.800
you're not right for scientific research?

11:25.120 --> 11:27.040
I hope you could think yourself clearly

11:27.410 --> 11:29.000
before you make any decisions.

11:29.290 --> 11:31.210
But not thinking about me all the time.

11:31.440 --> 11:33.480
You keep saying they are all my decisions.

11:33.650 --> 11:34.650
What about you?

11:35.330 --> 11:38.410
Don't you even have a crush on me at all?

12:37.970 --> 12:39.210
Did I wake you up?

12:40.920 --> 12:42.090
I'm sorry, Su.

12:42.680 --> 12:44.210
I fell asleep.

12:44.330 --> 12:46.240
Never mind. You look tired.

12:46.330 --> 12:47.360
Get more rest.

12:47.560 --> 12:48.890
I got nothing to do today.

12:49.890 --> 12:52.680
No, thank you. Go ahead with your business.

12:53.600 --> 12:55.360
I gotta go back to school.

12:57.090 --> 12:57.970
Thank you.

12:58.600 --> 12:59.480
Okay.

13:11.650 --> 13:13.560
I'll never make you feel aggrieved again.

13:27.170 --> 13:28.850
You get up early today.

13:30.210 --> 13:31.040
Yeah.

13:31.850 --> 13:34.170
You looked a bit down before.

13:34.600 --> 13:36.890
Anything happened?

13:38.560 --> 13:39.440
Nothing.

13:40.330 --> 13:41.600
Thanks for your concern.

13:41.920 --> 13:42.920
Never mind.

13:44.040 --> 13:45.360
Today's weekend. Would you like to

13:45.560 --> 13:48.210
have a hotpot with me?

13:48.560 --> 13:49.440
No, thanks.

13:51.210 --> 13:53.240
I'm gonna do my own business.

13:58.850 --> 13:59.850
Why are you still in bed?

14:00.410 --> 14:01.770
I bought you breakfast.

14:03.240 --> 14:04.440
Stop talking. I got a headache.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.170
Just let me sleep for a while.

14:14.800 --> 14:18.650
The second series of national broadcast gymnastics for middle school students:

14:18.920 --> 14:21.000
The Times Are Calling.

14:25.970 --> 14:26.920
Are you insane?

14:27.440 --> 14:28.330
I got a terrible headache.

14:28.330 --> 14:29.480
Why don't you allow me to have more rest?

14:30.290 --> 14:32.290
Don't you do the housework when you live here?

14:32.730 --> 14:33.970
What housework?

14:35.040 --> 14:36.850
We're two losers in love.

14:36.850 --> 14:37.800
Just let me sleep.

14:38.240 --> 14:40.120
I'm not a loser as you.

14:40.120 --> 14:42.170
You are such a drunkard.

14:47.560 --> 14:48.290
Hello?

14:48.290 --> 14:49.240
Zhou Siyue, it's me.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.360
Kong Shadi?

14:56.290 --> 14:57.090
What's the matter?

14:57.210 --> 14:59.530
Is Song Ziqi at your place?

15:01.850 --> 15:02.770
No.

15:03.410 --> 15:04.560
I don't buy it.

15:04.800 --> 15:06.210
Tell me to my face.

15:06.210 --> 15:07.240
I'm waiting for you outside your school gate.

15:07.360 --> 15:08.330
Come out now.

15:09.210 --> 15:09.530
What?

15:09.530 --> 15:10.800
Come out quickly.

15:11.000 --> 15:11.680
I'm telling you.

15:11.850 --> 15:13.290
I won't leave

15:13.360 --> 15:14.770
until you come out.

15:14.920 --> 15:15.730
Bye.

15:16.120 --> 15:17.560
You are at my school...

15:21.560 --> 15:22.410
What can I do now?

15:28.170 --> 15:28.890
President

15:29.090 --> 15:32.040
This is my portfolio for the competition of the publishers.

15:32.440 --> 15:35.440
But it's overdue.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.290
By the way,

15:42.440 --> 15:44.920
do you know how to contact the chief editor?

15:56.410 --> 15:57.090
Hello,

15:57.890 --> 15:59.040
I come to visit your

15:59.210 --> 16:01.680
chief editor, Sun Yuanxiang.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.650
Have you made an appointment?

16:04.480 --> 16:05.480
Sorry, no.

16:06.040 --> 16:07.850
I'll make a call for you.

16:07.850 --> 16:09.000
Thank you.

16:23.360 --> 16:24.210
Shadi

16:32.560 --> 16:34.410
Where is Song Ziqi on earth?

16:37.770 --> 16:38.970
I have no idea.

16:39.410 --> 16:40.970
How is that possible?

16:41.440 --> 16:43.000
You are his best friend.

16:44.850 --> 16:45.970
If you come to

16:46.920 --> 16:48.410
me for this,

16:49.600 --> 16:50.730
I gotta go then.

16:52.000 --> 16:53.850
At least we have known each other for a dozen years.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.770
You really don't like me this much?

16:58.290 --> 17:01.000
Shadi, it's not about you.

17:01.000 --> 17:01.890
Zhou Siyue

17:02.680 --> 17:04.650
I'm asking you seriously.

17:05.649 --> 17:07.720
Did Song Ziqi get kicked out of school?

17:08.320 --> 17:09.360
I have known it all.

17:09.690 --> 17:11.000
I went to his school.

17:12.450 --> 17:15.169
He just got a disciplinary punishment and a one-year suspension.

17:24.080 --> 17:25.960
You do know everything.

17:26.480 --> 17:28.690
I have always treated you like my brother.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.450
How could you do this to me?

17:34.930 --> 17:35.840
Shadi

17:37.410 --> 17:39.960
You've always been clinging to Song Ziqi.

17:41.120 --> 17:42.360
From the kindergarten,

17:42.770 --> 17:44.650
you did the same things as him.

17:45.410 --> 17:46.720
Have you ever thought about that

17:47.320 --> 17:49.120
it's your own life.

17:49.360 --> 17:50.600
Why do you take him as your

17:50.600 --> 17:52.200
goal and your direction?

17:52.770 --> 17:54.770
You guys are the same,

17:55.170 --> 17:56.600
saying that it's for our benefits.

17:57.000 --> 17:57.720
Why do you always sit up high

17:57.720 --> 17:59.170
in the leading position,

17:59.170 --> 18:00.690
and decide everything?

18:01.450 --> 18:02.320
You have no idea what

18:02.320 --> 18:04.410
Song Ziqi means to me.

18:08.360 --> 18:09.770
He broke up with me with no explanation.

18:10.170 --> 18:12.240
What about my feelings?

18:16.080 --> 18:17.360
Zhou Siyue, you don't understand.

18:18.600 --> 18:20.410
Song Ziqi can't just disappear.

18:22.810 --> 18:24.810
What if Ding Xian disappears too,

18:25.690 --> 18:26.770
leaving you forever?

18:28.450 --> 18:29.690
Have you ever thought about it?

18:39.930 --> 18:40.650
Wait a moment.

18:40.770 --> 18:41.170
Okay.

18:41.770 --> 18:42.570
Go ahead.

18:43.290 --> 18:44.080
Thank you.

18:46.050 --> 18:46.930
Have a seat, please.

18:53.290 --> 18:54.360
Nice to meet you, Ms. Sun.

18:54.650 --> 18:57.360
I'm Ding Xian from the Comics Club
of Huaqing University.

18:57.810 --> 18:58.770
I know you.

18:59.050 --> 19:00.450
Anything I can help you?

19:02.000 --> 19:04.840
I wanna show you my drawings.

19:11.240 --> 19:12.120
Tell me.

19:12.360 --> 19:13.410
What do you need?

19:15.600 --> 19:16.480
I want to

19:16.960 --> 19:19.890
take part in your drawing competition.

19:21.410 --> 19:22.770
But it has already passed

19:23.600 --> 19:24.600
the deadline.

19:25.050 --> 19:28.050
I know. So I come to ask if

19:28.240 --> 19:30.770
there are any other ways?

19:31.000 --> 19:31.960
How about

19:32.690 --> 19:34.840
leaving your portfolio here.

19:35.170 --> 19:37.200
If you haven't received any messages
till tomorrow,

19:37.480 --> 19:38.960
you are out of chance.

19:40.360 --> 19:42.770
Okay, thank you, Ms. Sun.

19:44.120 --> 19:46.170
I'm expecting to hear from you.

19:46.600 --> 19:47.570
Thanks.

19:56.890 --> 19:57.650
Xianxian

19:57.960 --> 19:58.930
Shadi

19:59.200 --> 20:00.570
What took you so long?

20:02.080 --> 20:03.890
I'm too busy lately.

20:04.530 --> 20:07.170
Stay with me tonight.

20:07.810 --> 20:10.480
But there will be a roll-call at eleven.

20:10.480 --> 20:11.530
I gotta come back.

20:12.080 --> 20:13.570
It's been a long time.

20:14.050 --> 20:15.170
Don't you want to spend

20:15.320 --> 20:18.000
a night of girls?

20:20.810 --> 20:23.050
Alright. You beat me.

20:27.690 --> 20:30.240
I went to the hospital to visit Zhou
a few days ago.

20:30.650 --> 20:31.690
So

20:32.530 --> 20:34.000
concentrate in your major.

20:35.170 --> 20:36.450
Just come to me if

20:37.000 --> 20:38.450
you need money.

20:39.050 --> 20:41.050
It's okay. I can do it.

20:41.770 --> 20:43.530
Mind your health.

20:43.930 --> 20:45.200
You know what,

20:45.720 --> 20:47.240
the selection of exchange students

20:47.570 --> 20:48.600
has already started.

20:48.890 --> 20:49.960
It won't not be a problem for you
to study abroad

20:50.530 --> 20:52.530
once you finish this project.

20:53.530 --> 20:54.320
Okay.

20:54.890 --> 20:55.890
One more thing.

20:57.720 --> 21:00.290
Ding Xian came to me a few days ago,

21:01.050 --> 21:03.570
saying that she found something she is more interested in

21:03.890 --> 21:05.650
and she wanted to quit the group.

21:05.840 --> 21:06.690
I said yes.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.080
It's great.

21:14.320 --> 21:15.410
I had no idea

21:15.930 --> 21:17.080
so many things happened

21:17.240 --> 21:19.360
between you and Zhou Siyue.

21:20.240 --> 21:22.120
What's that senior's name exactly?

21:22.120 --> 21:22.930
Which department does she in?

21:23.290 --> 21:24.650
I can meet her for you.

21:25.200 --> 21:26.690
You missed the point.

21:27.360 --> 21:29.170
It has already happened.

21:29.770 --> 21:31.000
I'm not thinking of him anymore.

21:33.890 --> 21:34.720
You know what?

21:35.170 --> 21:36.570
I've been always thinking that

21:36.960 --> 21:39.600
it must be you to stay with Zhou Siyue.

21:41.650 --> 21:44.050
What about now?

21:45.360 --> 21:46.890
Now I'm confused too.

21:47.930 --> 21:49.650
Relationship between lovers
has become so complicated

21:50.000 --> 21:53.240
since we grow up.

22:02.450 --> 22:03.720
What shall we have for lunch?

22:05.000 --> 22:06.480
It's up to you.

22:07.410 --> 22:09.170
I always want to eat...

22:09.410 --> 22:10.120
What?

22:10.770 --> 22:11.650
Mr. Charming.

22:37.000 --> 22:38.360
What's fun in the phone?

22:38.720 --> 22:39.840
Even ignored Mr. Charming.

22:40.570 --> 22:42.050
I'm waiting for the call from the press.

22:43.290 --> 22:44.570
So you and Zhou Siyue...

22:45.450 --> 22:46.530
Don't mention him.

22:48.000 --> 22:49.360
Did you cut off the thread of love?

22:50.600 --> 22:52.960
Yeah, now I am ascetic.

22:52.960 --> 22:54.410
I only concerned about my career.

22:54.770 --> 22:55.810
It can't be better.

22:56.570 --> 22:57.600
Ding Xian

22:59.200 --> 23:00.240
I finally got you.

23:00.650 --> 23:01.960
What's the matter, President?

23:02.450 --> 23:04.290
Ms. Sun from the Dream Journey Press
has come to you.

23:05.600 --> 23:07.080
Do I get the chance for the competition?

23:07.290 --> 23:09.450
No, she's going to sign a contract with you.

23:11.600 --> 23:12.530
Sign a contract?

23:13.360 --> 23:14.410
For real?

23:14.690 --> 23:15.450
Yes.

23:17.410 --> 23:18.480
I knew it.

23:19.000 --> 23:20.720
Why doesn't she come to me herself?

23:21.000 --> 23:22.480
She said you were in a rush,

23:22.690 --> 23:24.320
with no contact left.

23:24.320 --> 23:25.320
How could she come to you herself?

23:26.360 --> 23:27.320
Right.

23:38.890 --> 23:41.170
Is this the popular novel The Shadow

23:41.170 --> 23:42.960
on the Lijiang Literary website?

23:43.650 --> 23:46.360
Do you want me to adapt it into a comic?

23:46.720 --> 23:47.600
What do you think?

23:47.960 --> 23:48.840
Do you have the confidence?

23:51.650 --> 23:53.120
The contract has already been drawn up.

23:54.120 --> 23:55.450
Take a look.

23:56.810 --> 23:58.960
If there's no argument about the price,

23:59.600 --> 24:02.200
we can set about the next step.

24:08.650 --> 24:11.960
May I take it back and have a close look?

24:12.240 --> 24:13.120
Of course.

24:13.930 --> 24:15.000
But there are still

24:16.170 --> 24:18.570
lots of candidates for this project.

24:18.890 --> 24:19.810
I'm a little worried.

24:20.080 --> 24:21.480
You know, time waits for no one.

24:24.690 --> 24:26.530
Thanks for your trust.

24:27.200 --> 24:29.360
I ought to keep faith with you too.

24:45.960 --> 24:47.480
Mr. Su, this is the sponsoring proposal

24:47.480 --> 24:49.570
of the Comics Club of Huaqing University.

24:49.930 --> 24:51.360
The contact information is on the last page.

24:52.530 --> 24:53.930
Okay, thank you.

25:08.050 --> 25:08.930
Hello.

25:08.930 --> 25:09.810
Is this Xing Lufei?

25:10.290 --> 25:11.240
Yes.

25:12.200 --> 25:13.570
I'm not sure if you remember me or not.

25:14.000 --> 25:16.200
I'm Su Bocong, from Chima Technology.

25:16.960 --> 25:18.960
Would you like to

25:19.240 --> 25:20.410
go out for a dinner today?

25:21.770 --> 25:23.930
I happen to have a few high school mates

25:23.930 --> 25:25.000
from Huaqing University.

25:25.360 --> 25:27.080
We'd like to gather with you.

25:27.080 --> 25:28.650
You may know them.

25:32.960 --> 25:34.530
You have not uttered a single word since you came back.

25:34.840 --> 25:36.450
It's not like you, Mr. Zhou.

25:37.960 --> 25:38.890
Was I being too mean

25:39.450 --> 25:41.240
the other day?

25:42.890 --> 25:44.000
Which day?

25:45.480 --> 25:46.570
Don't play dumb with me.

25:49.000 --> 25:50.200
You were not only being mean.

25:50.450 --> 25:51.770
You were being a jerk.

26:00.170 --> 26:01.650
I just wanted her to

26:01.650 --> 26:03.200
do something she likes.

26:04.360 --> 26:06.720
She shouldn't sacrifice herself for me.

26:08.450 --> 26:09.480
Do you feel regret?

26:10.120 --> 26:12.080
She may not talk to you now even if you come to her.

26:12.720 --> 26:13.570
You deserve it.

26:13.690 --> 26:14.600
You dug yourself a grave.

26:35.770 --> 26:38.360
I thought you don't like dinner parties.

26:40.240 --> 26:41.840
But this one, I must go.

26:47.050 --> 26:48.450
Bocong, sorry to keep you waiting.

26:48.450 --> 26:49.290
You are here.

26:50.360 --> 26:52.360
Hello,
I'm the president of the Comics Club, Ji Hang.

26:52.600 --> 26:54.810
I'm Su Bocong, nice to meet you.

26:55.240 --> 26:56.170
Please be seated.

26:56.290 --> 26:57.290
Xianxian, sit here.

27:03.570 --> 27:04.410
Su

27:05.360 --> 27:08.050
I didn't know you are the sponsor.

27:09.570 --> 27:10.410
Ding Xian

27:10.570 --> 27:12.690
If we know you two are this close,

27:12.890 --> 27:14.720
you'd be in charge of the sponsorship.

27:16.770 --> 27:17.810
Where's Zhou Siyue?

27:20.080 --> 27:21.570
He's on the way.

27:27.570 --> 27:28.720
We've just arrived.

27:28.960 --> 27:29.810
Have a seat here.

27:39.170 --> 27:40.000
Zhou Siyue

27:40.450 --> 27:41.360
It's been a long time.

27:42.450 --> 27:43.410
Right, it's been a long time.

27:45.170 --> 27:46.960
It seems you've known each other.

27:47.240 --> 27:48.840
No more introduction then.

27:49.770 --> 27:51.600
Let's start to order now.

27:52.290 --> 27:53.770
What would you like to eat?

27:57.530 --> 27:58.530
Xianxian

27:58.690 --> 27:59.840
What would you like to eat?

28:00.530 --> 28:02.360
Zhou Siyue, this is for you.

28:03.320 --> 28:04.930
Sorry to take your

28:04.930 --> 28:05.840
chocolates last time.

28:05.840 --> 28:07.600
I got you a same one.

28:08.450 --> 28:10.080
Stop being mad at me.

28:21.450 --> 28:22.360
Come on, let's eat up.

28:24.360 --> 28:26.000
Bocong is so young and promising.

28:26.570 --> 28:27.960
You only graduated two years earlier than us,

28:28.200 --> 28:30.360
but you've already started to invest us.

28:31.120 --> 28:32.410
You are much more excellent.

28:33.170 --> 28:34.000
I was just

28:34.290 --> 28:35.840
being lucky to

28:36.050 --> 28:37.600
be appreciated.

28:38.120 --> 28:39.170
You are too modest.

28:41.890 --> 28:42.810
Xianxian

28:43.120 --> 28:44.050
This Sour Soup Fish tastes

28:44.240 --> 28:45.810
similar to that in our hometown.

28:46.450 --> 28:47.450
Have a try.

28:48.530 --> 28:50.240
Ding Xian doesn't like sour things.

28:57.480 --> 28:58.770
Don't you like it anymore?

29:02.240 --> 29:03.240
I'll have a taste.

29:13.650 --> 29:14.530
How do you like it?

29:20.650 --> 29:21.840
Well, Bocong

29:22.410 --> 29:24.080
I am quite curious.

29:25.240 --> 29:26.200
For what?

29:27.450 --> 29:29.450
What's the relationship between

29:30.000 --> 29:31.690
you and our little sister Ding Xian?

29:36.650 --> 29:38.690
My parents get on well with his family.

29:39.240 --> 29:41.360
So we've known each other since we were kids.

29:41.570 --> 29:42.690
Grow up together.

29:42.890 --> 29:45.600
So you are childhood sweethearts.

29:48.120 --> 29:49.050
I mean it seems that

29:49.240 --> 29:51.170
Bocong has a crush on you.

29:55.170 --> 29:56.530
I do like her

29:59.480 --> 30:01.410
and I'm going to invite her

30:01.600 --> 30:02.840
to my company when she graduates.

30:07.530 --> 30:09.320
Of course, you're all

30:09.650 --> 30:10.690
warmly welcomed.

30:11.570 --> 30:14.240
Bocong, you are so nice to Xianxian.

30:21.000 --> 30:22.290
I need to go to the toilet.

30:26.360 --> 30:27.600
Excuse me.

30:28.240 --> 30:29.050
Help yourselves.

30:36.290 --> 30:37.200
Zhou Siyue

30:52.080 --> 30:54.770
What are you going to say?

30:56.050 --> 30:57.410
I like Ding Xian.

31:02.320 --> 31:03.240
So what?

31:05.050 --> 31:07.290
I like her since we were kids.

31:07.960 --> 31:09.690
I'll gradually make up the hurt

31:09.930 --> 31:11.050
she got from you.

31:12.170 --> 31:14.530
I'm capable of giving her a better life.

31:15.480 --> 31:17.240
So please get away from her.

31:18.810 --> 31:20.720
What's between her and me

31:21.690 --> 31:23.410
has nothing to do with you.

31:27.930 --> 31:30.080
Despite my relationship with Xianxian,

31:31.170 --> 31:33.080
I have promised Xianxian's parents

31:33.240 --> 31:34.450
to take care of her.

31:36.170 --> 31:38.650
So I'm responsible for her stuff.

31:39.120 --> 31:40.600
Why don't you talk about your relationship?

31:41.720 --> 31:43.360
I'd like to know what kind of relationship

31:44.360 --> 31:46.810
between you and Ding Xian.

31:52.000 --> 31:54.410
What about yours?

32:01.320 --> 32:04.050
No matter what relationship between us now,

32:06.120 --> 32:09.600
she will only be with me for her life.

32:22.120 --> 32:23.050
Xianxian

32:33.890 --> 32:34.690
Ding Xian

32:36.530 --> 32:37.290
Ding Xian

32:40.600 --> 32:43.360
Zhou Siyue, what else do you want?

32:44.410 --> 32:45.410
I was being too harsh

32:46.530 --> 32:47.930
to you the other day.

32:50.050 --> 32:51.000
I'm so sorry.

32:53.240 --> 32:55.200
I didn't expect Mr. Zhou would apologize.

32:57.360 --> 32:58.720
After that day,

32:59.960 --> 33:01.600
I've been thinking all the time.

33:03.410 --> 33:05.170
I can't imagine

33:05.570 --> 33:07.240
what my life will be

33:07.240 --> 33:08.600
without you.

33:09.320 --> 33:11.290
Stop flattering yourself, Zhou Siyue.

33:11.890 --> 33:13.050
You have no right to

33:13.200 --> 33:15.000
decide the relationship between us,

33:15.320 --> 33:17.200
nor make decisions for me.

33:19.410 --> 33:21.690
I said you are not the center of my life any more.

33:21.890 --> 33:23.480
You don't need to make any explanations to me.

33:24.080 --> 33:24.960
Ding Xian

33:28.600 --> 33:29.960
Calm down please.

33:30.930 --> 33:31.480
Honestly...

33:31.480 --> 33:32.450
Calm down?

33:33.200 --> 33:34.000
You think I'm totally

33:34.000 --> 33:35.930
obsessed with you, right?

33:36.570 --> 33:38.770
Or is it fun to play me like a fool?

33:39.770 --> 33:41.450
You just get used to having me

33:41.450 --> 33:43.480
follow you all the time.

33:45.690 --> 33:47.770
But I'm really tired, now

33:49.570 --> 33:51.050
We're over now.

34:24.210 --> 34:25.120
Xianxian

34:28.210 --> 34:29.690
Get in the car. I'll give you a ride.

34:42.799 --> 34:43.759
Xianxian

34:44.650 --> 34:45.840
It seems the dishes today

34:45.840 --> 34:47.009
didn't suit your taste.

34:47.650 --> 34:49.360
Would you like to eat something else?

34:51.410 --> 34:52.650
Thank you, Su.

34:53.690 --> 34:54.690
I'm not hungry.

34:57.170 --> 34:58.760
Have you heard

34:59.320 --> 35:00.490
what we said in the restaurant?

35:04.360 --> 35:06.080
Only a part of it.

35:08.320 --> 35:10.650
But it's enough.

35:13.970 --> 35:14.930
It is all over.

35:16.930 --> 35:18.650
I won't feel upset for him any longer.

35:21.650 --> 35:24.280
How about I come back to Shen Hai with you in the New Year's vacation.

35:25.080 --> 35:26.170
I can also get some fresh air.

35:26.840 --> 35:29.210
I can't go with you.

35:30.490 --> 35:31.690
I still have a Comicon to go in Huaicheng.

35:53.250 --> 35:54.210
Kong Shadi

35:56.250 --> 35:57.280
It's me.

36:03.650 --> 36:04.650
Listen to me.

36:05.010 --> 36:06.360
I just had a nightmare,

36:07.080 --> 36:08.560
in which Kong Shadi and I

36:09.170 --> 36:10.760
were stuck in a rainforest.

36:10.970 --> 36:12.120
We were on a big tree,

36:12.450 --> 36:13.930
with lots of crocodiles below.

36:14.210 --> 36:15.250
Then she said to me,

36:15.730 --> 36:16.970
Song Ziqi, I will feed you to the crocodiles.

36:16.970 --> 36:19.560
And she pushed me off right away.

36:23.360 --> 36:24.280
So scary.

36:25.600 --> 36:26.730
Song Ziqi

36:26.730 --> 36:27.800
I got one question for you.

36:28.890 --> 36:31.650
What would you do

36:33.760 --> 36:35.010
if Kong Shadi disappears some day?

36:39.320 --> 36:41.490
Such a boring question.

37:10.890 --> 37:12.890
I've thought about it very clearly.

37:13.730 --> 37:16.320
It was all over between us.

37:18.930 --> 37:20.320
You'd better give up too.

37:22.010 --> 37:24.010
Song Ziqi would have come to you

37:24.360 --> 37:25.760
if he wants to see you.

37:26.600 --> 37:28.360
Don't curse on

37:28.360 --> 37:29.970
my love.

37:30.410 --> 37:32.760
I'll find him

37:32.930 --> 37:34.690
wherever he goes.

37:34.970 --> 37:37.450
I must know the answer.

37:39.800 --> 37:43.800
It's not that important to know the answer.

37:45.450 --> 37:48.170
You are forcing yourself to accept that

37:48.360 --> 37:49.930
it's not important.

37:50.970 --> 37:54.040
Can you really give up easily?

37:54.840 --> 37:56.360
I know I can't.

37:57.800 --> 37:59.120
I know I can't

37:59.280 --> 38:00.930
give up easily.

38:02.320 --> 38:03.410
And I can't help falling in love with him

38:04.120 --> 38:07.280
every time I see him.

38:08.650 --> 38:10.730
But I have to tell myself

38:12.210 --> 38:14.410
to hang in as possible as I can.

38:14.840 --> 38:15.800
Alright.

38:16.690 --> 38:19.250
I'm always here to support you.

38:20.210 --> 38:20.970
Bye-bye.

38:21.080 --> 38:22.040
Bye.

38:39.010 --> 38:42.410
Zhou Siyue, why do I have to be the one

38:42.410 --> 38:44.410
who knows you the least?

38:45.080 --> 38:47.800
Why can't you just be honest with me?

38:51.280 --> 38:52.930
It has been four years, Zhou Siyue.

38:53.760 --> 38:55.730
Do you really think I haven't confirmed it myself?

38:56.490 --> 38:58.250
I have asked myself for a thousand times,

38:58.250 --> 38:59.890
am I fall in love with you,

39:00.970 --> 39:03.250
or it's just an illusion in puberty?

39:05.250 --> 39:06.170
The only thing I can

39:06.320 --> 39:08.080
be sure in this world

39:10.120 --> 39:12.010
is my feelings toward you.

39:17.490 --> 39:18.800
You just get used to having me

39:18.970 --> 39:20.600
follow you all the time.

39:21.890 --> 39:23.520
But I'm really tired, now.

39:25.560 --> 39:27.080
We are over now.

40:03.040 --> 40:04.010
Hey, Xianxian.

40:04.010 --> 40:04.970
Hey, Su.

40:05.600 --> 40:07.490
I got your present.

40:07.840 --> 40:10.560
It's too valuable. I can't keep it.

40:10.890 --> 40:12.520
You must keep it.

40:12.800 --> 40:14.650
I knew you wouldn't accept it to my face.

40:14.650 --> 40:16.280
So I asked someone to put it at your dorm.

40:17.690 --> 40:19.410
If you feel apologetic,

40:20.210 --> 40:23.320
draw more and better pictures with it.

40:23.320 --> 40:24.690
Take it as a sort of investment.

40:27.730 --> 40:28.890
Thank you.

40:29.840 --> 40:32.250
I'll save up to give you a birthday...

40:32.250 --> 40:33.040
Xianxian

40:33.320 --> 40:34.320
I got another call.

40:34.450 --> 40:35.520
I gotta go.

40:35.840 --> 40:36.650
Okay.

40:36.840 --> 40:38.010
Okay, see you.

40:39.120 --> 40:40.040
Bye-bye.

41:28.840 --> 41:29.970
Song Ziqi

41:43.560 --> 41:44.520
Hello?

41:45.800 --> 41:46.760
Where are you?

41:46.760 --> 41:47.800
Kong Shadi's around.

41:48.250 --> 41:50.360
I'm worried she may follow you to find me.

41:50.600 --> 41:52.650
So I just come out and hide for a while.

41:53.250 --> 41:54.450
Good for you.

41:54.560 --> 41:55.520
I gotta go.

43:00.520 --> 43:01.490
Song Ziqi

43:02.410 --> 43:04.170
Miss, you got the wrong person.

43:04.560 --> 43:06.010
Who's Song Ziqi?

43:14.930 --> 43:15.760
Song Ziqi!

43:24.210 --> 43:25.800
Song Ziqi, stand still.

43:26.010 --> 43:27.080
Wait for me.

43:39.210 --> 43:40.280
Hey, Shasha.

43:40.760 --> 43:41.760
Hey, Ding Xian.

43:41.930 --> 43:43.360
Zhou Siyue is a big liar.

43:44.690 --> 43:45.840
What did he do?

43:46.040 --> 43:47.970
He lied to me that he didn't know where Song Ziqi is.

43:48.080 --> 43:49.840
He's been right here.

43:50.890 --> 43:52.170
How did you know?

43:53.560 --> 43:54.840
I just saw him.

43:55.040 --> 43:56.010
I'm so mad.

43:56.890 --> 43:57.970
I'm going to your school later.

43:58.120 --> 43:59.040
Get out now.

43:59.690 --> 44:01.410
Wait a second. I'm on my way.

44:03.450 --> 44:05.210
What are we doing here exactly?

44:05.360 --> 44:06.600
I'm going to follow Siyue.

44:06.760 --> 44:08.170
He knows for sure where Song Ziqi is.

44:08.320 --> 44:09.250
I can surely find that jerk

44:09.250 --> 44:11.010
by following him.

44:11.410 --> 44:13.490
You can do it yourself. Why do you call me here?

44:13.730 --> 44:15.010
Aren't you my bestie?

44:15.170 --> 44:16.450
Come alone with me, please.

44:21.010 --> 44:23.280
What? How did she find you?

44:23.520 --> 44:24.450
How could I know she would go to

44:24.600 --> 44:26.410
the bookstore, bro?

44:26.840 --> 44:27.800
Bookstore?

44:28.360 --> 44:30.800
I didn't expect you would go to the bookstore either.

44:31.080 --> 44:32.560
You two are indeed a perfect match.

44:32.690 --> 44:34.280
Stop joking with me.

44:34.410 --> 44:35.690
Just tell me what should I do.

44:36.490 --> 44:37.560
Where are you right now?

44:37.760 --> 44:38.840
I'm at the basement.

44:39.360 --> 44:40.760
Come back now.

44:40.970 --> 44:41.890
I'm frightened.

44:42.890 --> 44:44.490
Alright, don't be frightened.

44:44.890 --> 44:46.040
I'm on my way.

44:49.120 --> 44:50.170
Don't be frightened.

44:50.840 --> 44:52.170
He is going back.

44:53.650 --> 44:54.690
Let's go, let's go.

45:13.490 --> 45:14.450
He's looking over here.

45:15.170 --> 45:16.080
It's okay.

45:17.010 --> 45:18.280
Will he find us?

45:18.600 --> 45:19.490
No, he won't.

45:22.280 --> 45:23.210
Have a look now.

45:23.650 --> 45:24.490
Let me see.

45:29.730 --> 45:30.650
He's gone.

45:40.760 --> 45:41.800
Didn't she follow you?

45:42.450 --> 45:43.360
She did,

45:43.650 --> 45:44.600
with Ding Xian.

45:46.210 --> 45:47.080
Take it easy.

45:47.840 --> 45:48.800
I saw them.

45:49.120 --> 45:50.730
They won't come here.

45:52.840 --> 45:53.800
Is it here?

45:53.970 --> 45:56.490
Well, are you sure you've got rid of them?

45:56.800 --> 45:58.320
Are you definitely sure...

45:58.320 --> 45:59.760
I thought I heard Song Ziqi's voice.

45:59.760 --> 46:00.760
You need to take this seriously.

46:00.760 --> 46:02.080
I'll be dead if she

46:02.080 --> 46:03.490
shows up at the door.

46:03.490 --> 46:04.250
Really.

46:04.250 --> 46:04.840
I could hardly sleep

46:04.840 --> 46:06.600
these days.

46:06.600 --> 46:08.170
I have nightmares every night.

46:10.010 --> 46:10.970
It should be here.

46:12.760 --> 46:13.600
Zhou Siyue
